OL,3,AUS actress Selma Blair arrested after
OL,4,Aallegedly attacking attendants on
OL,5,Aflight
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS actress Selma Blair has been
OL,8,Farrested and taken to hospital after
OL,9,Fauthorities say she attacked two flight
OL,10,Fattendants on a flight.
OL,12,FAirport officials said they responded
OL,13,Fto a call on Sunday about "a physically
OL,14,Fabusive passenger" on a Delta Airlines
OL,15,Fflight travelling from Los Angeles to
OL,16,FNew York. Two flight attendants were
OL,17,Fhurt and one was taken to hospital, the
OL,18,FNew York Port Authority said.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
