OL,3,AUS actress Selma Blair arrested after
OL,4,Aallegedly attacking attendants on
OL,5,Aflight
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 54-year-old actress, known most
OL,8,Ffamously for her roles in Legally
OL,9,FBlonde, Hellboy and Cruel Intentions,
OL,10,Fwas taken into custody and transported
OL,11,Fto hospital. The FBI is investigating.
OL,13,FBlair's publicist told the BBC that she
OL,14,F"experienced a medical emergency that
OL,15,Fled to the alleged conduct".
